<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to LocaLink</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #8b5cf6 100%); padding: 40px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: white; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .header h1 { color: white; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0 0; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    .body p { color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); color: white !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; margin: 8px 0 24px; }
    .footer { background: #f8fafc; padding: 20px 32px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .footer p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; margin: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo">📍 LocaLink</div>
      <h1>Welcome aboard, {{name}}!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
      <p>Your LocaLink account is ready. Start sharing your location with family and friends in real time.</p>
      <p style="text-align:center;">
        <a href="{{appUrl}}" class="cta">Open LocaLink</a>
      </p>
      <p>Here's what you can do right away:</p>
      <ul style="color:#475569;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">
        <li>Add friends and family to your circle</li>
        <li>See everyone on the live map</li>
        <li>Create groups for easy tracking</li>
        <li>Save important places for alerts</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Stay safe, stay connected.</p>
      <p>— The LocaLink Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{year}} LocaLink · You're receiving this because you signed up.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
